(Now step-by-step:)
(1. Attach task profile to origin_availability_alpha:)
(attach_task_profile origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Preconditions: candidate_created origin_availability_alpha (true), vehicle_allocated origin_availability_alpha (true), route_task_profile_available route_task_profile_alpha (true).)
(Effect: candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha; not route_task_profile_available route_task_profile_alpha.)
(2. Confirm candidate prepared for origin:)
(confirm_candidate_preparedness origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Preconditions: candidate_created origin_availability_alpha (true), vehicle_allocated origin_availability_alpha (true), candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha (now true), not candidate_prepared origin_availability_alpha (true initially).)
(Effect: candidate_prepared origin_availability_alpha.)
(3. Activate origin node:)
(activate_origin_node origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Preconditions: candidate_prepared origin_availability_alpha (true), candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha (true), origin_availability_node_linked origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha (true), not origin_node_ready origin_node_alpha (true initially), not origin_node_occupied origin_node_alpha (true initially).)
(Effect: origin_node_ready origin_node_alpha.)
(4. Load origin payload:)
(load_origin_payload origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha cargo_payload_alpha)
(Preconditions: candidate_prepared origin_availability_alpha (true), origin_availability_node_linked origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha (true), cargo_available cargo_payload_alpha (true), not origin_availability_locked origin_availability_alpha (true initially; we haven't locked yet).)
(Effect: origin_node_occupied origin_node_alpha, origin_availability_locked origin_availability_alpha, origin_payload_linked origin_availability_alpha cargo_payload_alpha, not cargo_available cargo_payload_alpha.)
(5. Unload origin payload:)
(unload_origin_payload origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha route_task_profile_alpha cargo_payload_alpha)
(Preconditions: candidate_prepared origin_availability_alpha (true), candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha (true), origin_availability_node_linked origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha (true), origin_node_occupied origin_node_alpha (true from load), origin_payload_linked origin_availability_alpha cargo_payload_alpha (true), not origin_availability_confirmed origin_availability_alpha (true; we haven't set confirmed yet).)
(Effect: origin_node_ready origin_node_alpha (still true), origin_availability_confirmed origin_availability_alpha, cargo_available cargo_payload_alpha, not origin_payload_linked origin_availability_alpha cargo_payload_alpha.)
(Note: origin_availability_locked remains true (unchanged). origin_node_occupied remains true.)
(Now after these, origin node ready & occupied, origin availability locked & confirmed, cargo available again.)
(Now we need to detach task profile from origin to free it for destination.)
(6. Detach task profile from origin:)
(detach_task_profile origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Preconditions: candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha (true).)
(Effect: route_task_profile_available route_task_profile_alpha, not candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha.)
(Now origin still prepared, node ready/occupied, lock/confirmed, cargo available.)
(Now we need to prepare destination.)
(7. Allocate vehicle to destination:)
(allocate_vehicle_unit destination_availability_alpha vehicle_unit_beta)
(Preconditions: candidate_created destination_availability_alpha (true), not vehicle_allocated destination_availability_alpha (true), vehicle_available vehicle_unit_beta (true initially).)
(Effect: vehicle_allocated destination_availability_alpha, candidate_vehicle_linked destination_availability_alpha vehicle_unit_beta, not vehicle_available vehicle_unit_beta.)
(8. Attach task profile to destination:)
(attach_task_profile destination_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Preconditions: candidate_created destination_availability_alpha (true), vehicle_allocated destination_availability_alpha (now true), route_task_profile_available route_task_profile_alpha (true after detach).)
(Effect: candidate_task_profile_linked destination_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha, not route_task_profile_available route_task_profile_alpha.)
(9. Confirm candidate prepared for destination:)
(confirm_candidate_preparedness destination_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Preconditions: candidate_created destination_availability_alpha (true), vehicle_allocated destination_availability_alpha (true), candidate_task_profile_linked destination_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha (true), not candidate_prepared destination_availability_alpha (true).)
(Effect: candidate_prepared destination_availability_alpha.)
(10. Activate destination node:)
(activate_destination_node destination_availability_alpha destination_node_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Preconditions: candidate_prepared destination_availability_alpha (true), candidate_task_profile_linked destination_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha (true), destination_availability_node_linked destination_availability_alpha destination_node_alpha (true), not destination_node_ready destination_node_alpha (true initially), not destination_node_occupied destination_node_alpha (true initially).)
(Effect: destination_node_ready destination_node_alpha.)
(11. Load destination payload:)
