(After step 12 (unload destination), we still have candidate_task_profile_linked destination_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha true. We need to detach it.)
(13. Detach task profile from destination:)
(detach_task_profile destination_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
