(Now we must also ensure that after we have done all other steps, the dispatch_allocated remains true (it is not changed by any other action except execute_schedule_dispatch which keeps it? Actually effect does not modify dispatch_allocated; it remains true. So fine.)
(Now we need to ensure vehicle_allocated shift_candidate_alpha remains true? The execute_schedule_dispatch effect does not affect vehicle_allocated or candidate_vehicle_linked? It sets vehicle_available ?vehicle_unit but does not modify candidate_vehicle_linked or vehicle_allocated. However we may want to keep candidate_vehicle_linked shift_candidate_alpha vehicle_unit_gamma true? Not required by goal. Goal does not require candidate_vehicle_linked for shift_candidate_alpha. It only requires vehicle_available vehicle_unit_gamma. So after dispatch, vehicle_unit_gamma becomes available, but candidate_vehicle_linked may still be true? The effect does not remove it. That's okay.)
